# db-service-db-shard

This chart deploys one DB Service database shard and its RT stream for the sharded databases reference architecture.

## Requirements

| Repository | Name | Version |
|------------|------|---------|
| file://../../../kxCharts/db | db | 0.1.0 |
| file://../../../kxCharts/rt | rt | 1.18.1 |

## Configuration Options

Configuration for the local `db` and `rt` subcharts is provided under the `db` and `rt` keys. See the chart READMEs under `referenceArchitectures/kxCharts/` for the full local configuration tables.
